# @teamzira packages (e.g. @teamzira/alloy) resolve from GitHub Packages.
#
# Auth uses NODE_AUTH_TOKEN so this one committed file works everywhere a fork
# builds — no per-repo edits:
#   - Vercel:  Project Settings → Environment Variables → add NODE_AUTH_TOKEN
#              (a GitHub PAT with read:packages). Substituted at install time.
#   - GitHub Actions: actions/setup-node injects it (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).
#   - Local dev: run `gh auth refresh -s read:packages` once, then export the
#              token in your shell profile: `export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token)`.
#              Reused across every repo cloned from this template.
#
# Heads-up: this substitutes ${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}, so an UNSET var resolves to
# empty and overrides ~/.npmrc — make sure it's exported locally.
@teamzira:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
